1
00:00:02,090 --> 00:00:07,710
Your account statement is on the Reports tab.

2
00:00:07,810 --> 00:00:12,070
Account Statement lists your trades, deposits and balance for a period.

3
00:00:12,170 --> 00:00:16,300
Choose the period: a day, week, month, quarter, year, or your own dates.

4
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:20,660
On the right, choose which account and how sizes are shown.

5
00:00:20,760 --> 00:00:25,120
Then click Run Report.

6
00:00:27,490 --> 00:00:31,750
The statement opens with your account details and the period at the top.

7
00:00:31,850 --> 00:00:41,250
Below are your transactions, one row each, with the balance after every one.

8
00:00:41,350 --> 00:00:46,580
Long statements are split into pages. Use these arrows to move between them.

9
00:00:46,680 --> 00:00:49,940
The page number is shown here.

10
00:00:50,040 --> 00:00:54,750
The back arrow returns to the previous page.

